qzIQ7kNvwHQslYg&_nc_oc=AdmiH82bVSENr3CAaHmVhwPLiAIYLea7aHl6qV9yz4rD71r5JLJCbx1C1kAhL7SeLWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfshA1aPKOGYWoJ47KrUwtuEiLi31sPyKlVfRdJLFqh7jQ&oe=69A19FB2"}, {"file_name": "landscape_4.png", "id": "5564456170299960", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402515_5564456173633293_8166203934336264507_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y90t_jOKzwYQ7kNvwGEQ9Ti&_nc_oc=AdneSXhjBxgU0wEBUH5T7r46vMPOX9cY7Tck6IqFqDFjyH2siYk5_JlgriDZ7RcXmb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuYO0sad95dUSfuQvXktp0FuTmvx6wEBbdXqfT0ao2sfQ&oe=69A18076"}, {"file_name": "landscape_5.png", "id": "634797031492068", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_634797034825401_6944852042907467801_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8tV33X6nwT0Q7kNvwGCciZe&_nc_oc=AdnsGeDDrjjfb_2H_dOj46b4WFe5D1x-Ik0nX1vqsba0hhNvj_rCI8WPDL7H2Ccqkqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs48Er1AHh46YypQT-tY0c70YLXhNbnvU4cPJL-tYgflg&oe=69A19E6B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Notre-Dame de Paris: Voyage dans le Pass\u00e9", "keywords": ["NotreDameDeParis", "NotreDame", "Paris"], "long_description": "(Re)-d\u00e9couvrez Notre-Dame de Paris telle qu\u2019elle \u00e9tait il y a 2 si\u00e8cles, pendant la R\u00e9volution Fran\u00e7aise. Au c\u0153ur du jeu vid\u00e9o Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity, la reconstitution 3D de la cath\u00e9drale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubisoft propose une visite en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle de Notre-Dame de Paris \